SUMMARY:Darkestest Secrets! There Will be Blood - Hosted by HH Holmes (RET
 URN FOR 2026)
DESCRIPTION:Toronto History Walks\n\\*\\***The Toronto History Walks Yearl
 y Pass is available. Get it now for $125.00 for 1 year of unlimited tours\
 , email**\n**torontohistorywalks@gmail.com**\n**for more information or fo
 r signing up!\\*\\***\n\n\\*\\* **Please note: Please e-transfer the ticke
 t amount when booking your space for this tour! You can e-transfer to the 
 following email at:**\n**torontohistorywalks@gmail.com**\n\nStart the fall
  season on a high note with this frightening walking tour hosted by **HH H
 olmes** the most prolific serial killer in American History. Considered th
 e first serial killer he will conduct this entire tour from beginning to e
 nd. It will keep you up late at night for days.\n\nThis tour will be hoste
 d and conducted by a man who committed some of the most vicious crimes\, a
 nd there is a Toronto connection to it all. He loved Toronto and wished it
  well.\n\nFrom serial killers to strange disappearances\, this tour will e
 xplore some of the most disturbing true life cases\, solved and unsolved\,
  over the last 140 years here in Toronto. From old Sayer Street in the old
  Ward to Hospital Row. In areas that one would find quiet\, and comfortabl
 e\, there are demons hiding\, some in plain sight. Like HH Holmes said jus
 t before he dropped through the trap door of the gallows at Moyamensing Pr
 ison\; "I always had the Devil in me."\n\nThis is not a **ghost** tour but
  a continuation of the Dark History of Toronto Series that started back in
  2019 with Volume 1.\n\nThis horrific walking tour is for all levels and w
 alkers. **But this tour is not for children under the age of 12**\n\nThe t
 our begins at the **Toronto Sign** in Nathan Philips Square. The tour ends
  at Bay and College Streets.\n\n**Please book early if you wish to attend 
 this event in October! And Mr. Holmes will be waiting\, patiently for your
  prompt RSVP!**\n\nThis tour has a ticket price of $15.00 person!\n\n\\*\\
 * **Please note: Please e-transfer the ticket amount when booking your spa
 ce for this tour! You can e-transfer to the following email at:**\n**toron
 tohistorywalks@gmail.com**
